from ground_author import *
source('keller-drains','凱勒：砂井替代型預製垂直排水板','Keller: Wick drains and prefabricated vertical drains','Keller Group','https://www.keller.com/expertise/techniques/wick-pvds-band-drains','公開排水板結構、縮短排水路徑與試驗區監測；不把宣傳工期當本課工期保證。','Public drain configuration, shortened drainage paths and trial-area monitoring; promotional time claims are not used as project guarantees.')
add('b189','低流動性灌漿的擠密、孔壓與資產反應~Low-mobility grout displacement, pore pressure and asset response','壓密灌漿主要藉低流動性漿團擠移周圍土體，適用性與排水、密實狀態及可容許位移密切相關。本課區分擠密、填空與劈裂，從孔壓、孔隙比、漿泡幾何及處理覆蓋出發，連結等待時間、地表隆起、資產推力與改善後的剩餘沉陷。~Compaction grouting displaces surrounding soil with low-mobility grout masses, with suitability governed by drainage, density and tolerable movement. The course distinguishes densification, void filling and fracture, connecting pore pressure, void ratio, bulb geometry and coverage to waiting time, heave, asset force and residual settlement.',compact(r'''
不排水孔壓~Undrained pore pressure || 低流動性漿團擠壓飽和土時，短時間內若水無法排出，部分總應力增量會轉成超額孔壓而非立即增加土骨架強度。反應取決於飽和度及應力路徑，不能因為注入壓力高就斷言地盤已變密；持續孔壓還可能暫時降低鄰近穩定。~Displacing saturated soil with low-mobility grout can convert much of a rapid total-stress increment into excess pore pressure rather than immediate skeleton strengthening. Response depends on saturation and stress path, so high injection pressure does not prove densification. Persistent pore pressure may temporarily reduce stability nearby. || 假設等向不排水增量Δσ=100 kPa、Skempton係數B=0.9，Δu=BΔσ=90 kPa~For an isotropic undrained increment Δσ=100 kPa and Skempton coefficient B=0.9, Δu=BΔσ=90 kPa || 以孔壓計與地表位移對照注入事件，檢查消散時間，並分辨管內壓力與土中孔壓。~Compare piezometers and surface movement with injection events, assess dissipation time, and distinguish pipe pressure from soil pore pressure. || 孔壓累積而未消散可能降低有效應力，使周邊地盤暫時軟化，補強過程反而造成位移。~Accumulated pore pressure reduces effective stress and can temporarily soften surrounding ground, causing movement during the improvement itself. || 注入壓力越高就表示土骨架已承受更多有效壓力。~Higher injection pressure always means greater effective stress in the soil skeleton. || 注入與等待的判據應由孔壓及位移共同支持；地工設計者核定停留點，不以泵壓單獨判定。~Use pore pressure and displacement together for injection and waiting criteria; the geotechnical designer approves hold points rather than relying on pump pressure alone. || B係數式限於指定等向不排水路徑，真實漿團擴張具有剪應力變化；非等向情境需更完整的孔壓反應模型。~The B relation applies to the stated isotropic undrained path; actual bulb expansion changes shear stress and needs a fuller pore-pressure model for nonisotropic loading.
孔隙比減少~Void-ratio reduction || 真正擠密需要土粒重新排列並減少土體孔隙，不能把漿液占據空洞直接當成原土密度提高。體積應變可由孔隙比變化估算，但前提是土粒體積不變且觀察的是同一土體；飽和細粒土還需要水能排出才能形成永久壓縮。~Densification requires grain rearrangement and reduced void space; grout occupying an empty cavity is not automatically denser native soil. Void-ratio change estimates volumetric strain if solid volume is fixed and the same soil mass is followed. Saturated fine soil also needs drainage for permanent compression to develop. || 假設e₀=0.8、e₁=0.7且固體體積不變，壓縮應變εv=(e₀−e₁)/(1+e₀)=0.0556=5.56%~For e₀=0.8 and e₁=0.7 at constant solid volume, compressive strain εv=(e₀−e₁)/(1+e₀)=0.0556=5.56% || 以處理前後密度與原位試驗比較，分層確認同一土體代表性，檢查材料移出或填入是否影響質量基準。~Compare pre- and post-treatment density and in-situ tests by layer, checking representativeness and whether added or removed material changed the mass basis. || 把空洞填充量當成土體壓縮量，會高估密實改善，處理後仍可能有鬆散土及差異沉陷。~Counting cavity fill as soil compression overstates densification and can leave loose ground and differential settlement after treatment. || 漿液填滿空隙與原土擠密是完全相同的改善機制。~Filling a cavity and densifying native soil are identical improvement mechanisms. || 成效報告應分開填空、擠密與地層位移證據；地工設計者確認機制後才接受改善指標。~Separate cavity-filling, densification and ground-displacement evidence in reports; the geotechnical designer confirms the mechanism before accepting improvement indicators. || 孔隙比式沒有描述漿團形狀及影響範圍，亦不能把整個場址都視為同樣壓縮；需由空間取樣驗證分布。~The void-ratio relation describes neither bulb shape nor influence extent and does not imply uniform site compression; spatial sampling must verify the distribution.
漿泡等效半徑~Equivalent grout-bulb radius || 低流動性漿材可形成團塊並向周圍擠壓，但實際形狀受土層、裂隙及應力控制，未必是球體。等效球半徑可把體積轉成直觀尺寸，僅供比較材料量與可能影響範圍；不能據此直接確定處理交疊或資產安全距離。~Low-mobility grout can form a mass that displaces its surroundings, but strata, fractures and stress control a shape that need not be spherical. Equivalent sphere radius converts volume into an intuitive size for comparison only; it cannot directly establish treatment overlap or safe separation from assets. || 假設漿體積V=0.5 m³且理想球形，r=(3V/(4π))^(1/3)=0.492 m~For grout volume V=0.5 m³ in an ideal sphere, r=(3V/(4π))^(1/3)=0.492 m || 以試驗區揭露、原位反應及材料平衡核對形狀假設，檢查弱層是否造成扁平擴展或側向漏失。~Check shape assumptions through trial-area exposure, in-situ response and material balance, examining weak-layer spreading or lateral loss. || 沿裂隙形成細長漿脈時，球形假設會高估四周擠密範圍，並低估遠處資產受影響可能。~Elongated grout veins along fractures invalidate spherical influence, overstating nearby densification and understating possible effects on distant assets. || 注入體積相同，就一定得到相同半徑的球形漿泡。~Equal injected volume always creates a spherical bulb of the same radius. || 試驗方案需驗證地層控制的漿體分布；地工設計者確認有效影響範圍後才安排處理網格。~Trials must verify ground-controlled grout distribution; the geotechnical designer confirms effective influence before laying out the treatment grid. || 等效半徑是體積換算，不是可測得的施工直徑或擠密半徑；流失、壓縮與裂隙注入都會改變實際幾何。~Equivalent radius is a volume conversion, not a demonstrated installation or densification radius; loss, compression and fracture entry change actual geometry.
處理覆蓋比例~Treatment coverage || 處理網格需涵蓋目標土層與資產下方，圓形影響區面積比可作初步幾何比較，卻不能證明各點都達到指定密度。相鄰孔交互擠壓及邊界效應會改變分布，未處理通道可能控制液化或沉陷表現，必須檢查連續弱區。~Treatment grids must cover the target strata and asset footprint. Circular influence-area ratio gives an initial geometric comparison but does not prove every point reaches target density. Interaction and edges alter distribution, while untreated corridors may govern liquefaction or settlement; continuous weak zones require explicit checks. || 假設影響半徑r=0.5 m、正方形網格s=1.2 m，面積比a=πr²/s²=0.545~For influence radius r=0.5 m and square spacing s=1.2 m, area ratio a=πr²/s²=0.545 || 在孔間及處理邊界配置原位試驗，將改善指標畫成平面及深度圖，檢查最低值連通性。~Test between holes and at treatment edges, mapping improvement in plan and depth and checking connectivity of the lowest-value zones. || 只在注入孔附近測試會高估覆蓋，孔間弱帶可能在後續載重或地震中仍產生集中變形。~Testing only near injection holes overstates coverage, leaving inter-hole weak corridors that deform under later loads or shaking. || 面積比超過一半就表示整個場址都改善了一半。~An area ratio above one half proves the entire site is half improved. || 驗收點應包含最不利孔間位置；地工設計者按功能需求核定覆蓋與補孔，不僅追求總孔數。~Acceptance includes adverse inter-hole locations; the geotechnical designer approves coverage and additional holes from performance needs rather than total count alone. || 這是幾何圓面積比，不是密實度、體積替代率或安全係數；影響半徑本身須由試驗建立且未必均勻。~This is a geometric circular-area ratio, not density, replacement ratio or safety factor; the influence radius requires testing and may be nonuniform.
孔壓消散時間~Pore-pressure dissipation time || 分階段壓密灌漿需辨別材料反應與土體排水的時間，未消散孔壓會改變下一階段有效應力。壓密理論的時間因子可估指定排水長度的尺度，但真實三維排水及土層各向異性可能主導；排程不能只由設備可用時間決定。~Staged grouting must distinguish material response from drainage time because remaining pore pressure changes the next stage's effective stress. Consolidation time factors estimate a scale for a specified drainage path, but three-dimensional drainage and anisotropy may govern. Equipment availability alone therefore cannot set the waiting interval. || 假設Tv=0.2、有效排水長Hdr=2 m、cv=1×10⁻⁷ m²/s，t=Tv Hdr²/cv=8×10⁶ s=92.6 day~For Tv=0.2, effective drainage path Hdr=2 m and cv=1×10⁻⁷ m²/s, t=Tv Hdr²/cv=8×10⁶ s=92.6 day || 以孔壓計量測消散曲線，核對排水邊界及cv試驗應力範圍，檢查是否有未觀測的低滲透夾層。~Measure dissipation with piezometers, verify drainage boundaries and the stress range of tested cv, and investigate unobserved low-permeability seams. || 等待不足會使超額孔壓累積，注入後土體尚未增強就承受下一次擠壓，造成不利位移。~Insufficient waiting accumulates excess pressure and subjects ground to further displacement before strengthening, causing adverse movement. || 前一孔灌漿結束就代表附近土體已完成壓密。~Completion of one injection means surrounding soil has fully consolidated. || 階段放行以核定孔壓及位移條件判定，地工設計者檢查排水假設後才調整等待安排。~Release stages using approved pressure and movement conditions; the geotechnical designer reviews drainage assumptions before waiting intervals change. || 此一維式只是指定時間因子的尺度，Tv並非任意等同某百分比；需用相應理論關係解讀壓密度且不可直接當施工工期。~The one-dimensional expression gives a scale at a specified time factor; Tv is not itself a consolidation percentage and requires the matching theoretical relation rather than direct schedule use.
地表隆起體積~Surface-heave volume || 擠密過程若土粒重排空間不足，注入可能轉成地表隆起或資產移動。以面積乘平均隆起可估觀測到的體積，但測區之外仍可能變形；把地表反應和注入量、孔壓一起比較，有助辨別壓縮、填空與抬升的比例。~When grain rearrangement has limited space, injection may become surface heave or asset movement. Area times mean heave estimates observed volume, but deformation can extend beyond the surveyed zone. Comparing this response with injected quantity and pore pressure helps separate compression, cavity filling and uplift contributions. || 假設觀測面積A=100 m²、平均隆起h=0.005 m，Vh=Ah=0.5 m³~For observed area A=100 m² and mean heave h=0.005 m, Vh=Ah=0.5 m³ || 用足夠密度的水準網積分位移，延伸到處理區外，並檢查是否有局部隆起被平均抹平。~Integrate movement from a sufficiently dense levelling grid extending outside treatment, checking whether local heave is hidden by the mean. || 平均隆起低仍可能有局部尖峰，造成脆性管線或既有基礎接縫損傷，不能只看總體積。~Low mean heave can hide a local peak that damages brittle utilities or foundation joints; total volume alone is insufficient. || 地表平均只抬升幾毫米，就不可能有局部資產損害。~A few millimetres of mean surface heave cannot damage local assets. || 資產附近需依結構敏感度加密測點；地工與資產負責人共同核定隆起及差異變位停留點。~Increase measurement density near sensitive assets; geotechnical and asset leads jointly set hold points for heave and differential movement. || 面積乘平均高程只描述測區表面變化，不等於全部漿液留存；應交代積分範圍、基準與測點密度。~Area times mean elevation describes the surveyed surface only, not total retained grout; report integration extent, datum and sampling density.
填空與擠密分辨~Void filling versus densification || 壓密灌漿遇到舊坑洞或鬆散填土時，漿液可能先填空，對周圍密度改善有限。材料平衡需區分已知空洞填充及真正擠移土體的部分，否則高注入量會被誤當高成效；不明耗量也是需要調查的地質訊號。~In old cavities or loose fill, grout may first fill empty space with little surrounding densification. Material balance should separate identified cavity fill from actual soil displacement, otherwise high consumption can be mistaken for high effectiveness. Unexplained consumption is also geological evidence requiring investigation. || 假設總注入V=3 m³，其中可證明填空Vvoid=2 m³，填空比例Vvoid/V=66.7%~For total injection V=3 m³ with verified cavity filling Vvoid=2 m³, the filling fraction is 66.7% || 以既有空洞調查、注入反應及後測密度交叉核對，追查高耗量卻低位移的區域。~Cross-check cavity investigation, injection response and post-treatment density, investigating high-consumption zones with little measured movement. || 高耗量若流入未調查空洞，可能無法改善目標土層，甚至轉移到鄰近設施造成堵塞。~High consumption into an uninvestigated cavity may leave the target stratum unimproved and migrate into neighbouring infrastructure. || 灌入量越大就能直接證明目標土體越密實。~Greater injected volume directly proves denser target soil. || 設計者應核定不明耗量調查及停留點；填空成果和擠密成果在驗收中分開證明。~The designer approves investigation and hold points for unexplained consumption; cavity-filling and densification outcomes are demonstrated separately at acceptance. || 比例只在空洞量可獨立證明時成立，剩餘三分之一也不能全部當作壓密；可能還有裂隙流失或地表隆起。~The fraction requires independently verified cavity volume; the remaining third is not necessarily all densification because fracture loss and surface heave may also occur.
資產推力~Asset reaction force || 既有管線或基礎若限制地盤擠移，位移會轉成額外作用力，剛度越高不代表受影響越小。簡化彈簧模型能說明小位移對剛性資產的力需求，但接觸開閉、土體塑性與結構接頭會造成非線性，須以實際界面分析。~When an existing utility or foundation restrains displacement, movement becomes additional force; high stiffness does not mean low impact. A spring model illustrates force demand from small movement of a stiff asset, while opening contact, soil plasticity and joints introduce nonlinearity requiring actual interface analysis. || 假設資產等效剛度k=200 MN/m、強迫位移δ=0.002 m，F=kδ=0.4 MN=400 kN~For asset stiffness k=200 MN/m and imposed movement δ=0.002 m, F=kδ=0.4 MN=400 kN || 量測資產位移與應變，核對支承邊界及接縫自由度，將地盤抬升轉換成相應結構需求。~Measure asset movement and strain, verify support boundaries and joint freedoms, and translate ground heave into corresponding structural demand. || 忽略剛性資產約束可能低估內力，外觀位移很小仍可能有大反力或接頭損傷。~Ignoring stiff asset restraint understates forces; small visible movement can coexist with large reactions or connection damage. || 資產很硬不容易移動，所以附近灌漿不會影響它。~A stiff asset barely moves, so nearby grouting cannot affect it. || 資產剛度與允許變形需由其結構負責人確認；灌漿設計者應依共同核定的界面模型訂控制目標。~The asset structural lead confirms stiffness and permissible movement; the grouting designer uses the jointly approved interface model for control objectives. || 彈簧常數屬特定方向與邊界，不是材料模數；兩毫米也不是通用允許變位，應與資產能力及不確定度比較。~The spring constant belongs to a direction and boundary condition rather than being a material modulus; two millimetres is not a universal permitted movement.
原位阻力增益~In-situ resistance gain || 處理前後錐尖阻力可比較地盤反應，但數值也受應力狀態、排水及測試位置影響。靠近硬漿團的高值不一定代表孔間原土同樣改善，應以統一程序和空間佈點評估；改善比更不能直接當抗液化安全係數。~Pre- and post-treatment cone resistance helps compare ground response but also depends on stress, drainage and test position. High resistance near hard grout does not prove equal improvement in native soil between bulbs. Use consistent procedures and spatial coverage, and do not interpret the gain ratio directly as liquefaction safety. || 假設相應地層qc由5 MPa增至8 MPa，相對增加(8−5)/5=60%~For comparable cone resistance increasing from qc=5 MPa to 8 MPa, relative gain (8−5)/5=60% || 對相同深度與地層作前後配對，記錄錐孔距灌漿孔位置，檢查孔壓及應力修正是否一致。~Pair pre- and post-tests by depth and stratum, record distance from grout holes, and check consistent pore-pressure and stress corrections. || 只選高阻力區會高估整體改善，未處理夾層仍可能控制沉陷或地震液化。~Selecting high-resistance areas overstates system improvement while untreated seams may still govern settlement or liquefaction. || 錐尖阻力增加六成，就代表所有承載與耐震能力增加六成。~A sixty-percent cone-resistance gain increases every bearing and seismic capacity by sixty percent. || 驗收指標需對應設計功能與測試位置；地工設計者核定低值區處置，不以全場平均增益替代。~Acceptance indicators match design function and test locations; the geotechnical designer determines low-zone treatment rather than substituting mean site-wide gain. || 百分比只比較兩個相應測值，未含統計分散與修正關係；要推估容量或液化阻抗，需另用經驗或力學模型。~The percentage compares two corresponding readings only, excluding scatter and correction relations; resistance or liquefaction assessment requires separate empirical or mechanical models.
剩餘沉陷~Residual settlement || 改良完成後仍可能有未處理土層或低改善區，總沉陷需把各層剩餘壓縮加總。分層應變可提供清楚的量級，但時間效應與荷載擴散會改變分布；移交不能只附灌漿量，還要保存後測與尚未消散孔壓的證據。~Untreated layers or poorly improved zones can remain after completion, so total settlement includes residual compression of each layer. Layered strains give a transparent scale, but time effects and stress spread alter the distribution. Handover therefore needs post-tests and remaining pore-pressure evidence rather than injected volume alone. || 假設兩層H₁=5 m、ε₁=0.002；H₂=3 m、ε₂=0.01，s=ε₁H₁+ε₂H₂=0.04 m=40 mm~For layers H₁=5 m, ε₁=0.002 and H₂=3 m, ε₂=0.01, s=ε₁H₁+ε₂H₂=0.04 m=40 mm || 用分層沉陷及後測資料確認剩餘壓縮來源，對照未來荷載計畫，檢查地表變形是否符合各層加總。~Use layered settlement and post-treatment data to identify residual compression, compare future loading, and check surface movement against the layer sum. || 忽略未改良深層會讓完工表現短暫良好，後續荷載下仍出現持續沉陷及差異變形。~Ignoring deeper untreated ground can produce short-term apparent success followed by continued and differential settlement under later loads. || 表層原位試驗改善就代表所有深度的沉陷都已消除。~Improved near-surface tests prove settlement has been eliminated at all depths. || 交接須列未處理層、剩餘沉陷及監測責任；地工設計者依資產需求確認驗收與長期追蹤。~Handover states untreated layers, residual settlement and monitoring responsibility; the geotechnical designer confirms acceptance and follow-up against asset requirements. || 分層加總假設各層應變可代表其厚度，未含三維側移與結構互制；四十毫米是算例結果，不是允許沉陷。~Layer summation assumes representative strain through each thickness and excludes three-dimensional lateral movement and structural interaction; forty millimetres is a result, not an allowable settlement.
'''),'原創教學例：假設飽和土受等向不排水總應力增量Δσ=100 kPa，Skempton係數B=0.9，超額孔壓Δu=BΔσ=90 kPa。只把總應力增量提高10%至110 kPa，B維持不變，Δu=99 kPa。這表示短時間內增加的荷載大部分由水壓反應承擔，不代表土骨架已永久增強。真實壓密灌漿並非等向試驗，還含剪應力、排水與漿泡形狀；應以孔壓消散及處理前後原位阻力共同確認改善，而非把高注入壓力當成密實度證據。~Original teaching example: assume saturated soil receives an isotropic undrained total-stress increment Δσ=100 kPa with Skempton coefficient B=0.9. Excess pressure is Δu=BΔσ=90 kPa. Increase only the stress increment by 10% to 110 kPa with B fixed and Δu becomes 99 kPa. Most of the short-term increment is therefore expressed in water pressure rather than demonstrated permanent skeleton strengthening. Actual compaction grouting is not an isotropic test and also involves shear, drainage and bulb geometry. Verify improvement using pressure dissipation and paired in-situ resistance tests rather than interpreting high injection pressure as density evidence.',['keller-compaction','fhwa-ground','geo-site'],['倫敦哈利街地下室：地盤位移限制比較~Harley Street basement: ground-movement constraints','Crossrail利物浦街：補償與擠密機理對照~Crossrail Liverpool Street: compensation versus compaction'])

add('b190','徑向排水、塗抹效應與壓密完成度~Radial drainage, smear effects and consolidation completion','砂井與預製排水板縮短軟土排水路徑，使超額孔壓較快消散，但不會直接消除土的可壓縮性。本課以網格幾何、等效直徑、水平壓密時間與安裝塗抹為主線，連結井阻、載重、沉陷及排水老化，建立以孔壓與變形共同判斷的卸載交接條件。~Sand drains and prefabricated drains shorten drainage paths and accelerate excess-pressure dissipation without eliminating compressibility. The course connects grid geometry, equivalent diameter, radial time and installation smear to well resistance, loading, settlement and drain deterioration, establishing unloading and handover criteria from both pressure and movement.',compact(r'''
排水距離尺度~Drainage-length scale || 排水路徑縮短會加快壓力擴散，理想擴散時間隨特徵長度平方變化，這是垂直排水構想的基礎。實際排水板網格同時改變影響半徑、井徑比與塗抹比例，不能只用長度平方比直接預測現場工期；土層排水方向也需要辨識。~Shorter drainage paths accelerate pressure diffusion, whose ideal characteristic time varies with squared length. This motivates vertical drains, but actual spacing changes influence radius, drain-size ratio and smear proportion together. A length-squared ratio alone therefore cannot predict field schedule, and relevant drainage directions must also be identified. || 僅在相同無因次幾何與材料參數的擴散尺度比較，L₁=5 m、L₂=1 m，t₂/t₁=(L₂/L₁)²=0.04~Only for diffusion scaling with identical dimensionless geometry and material parameters, L₁=5 m and L₂=1 m give t₂/t₁=(L₂/L₁)²=0.04 || 以壓密試驗與分層孔壓建立排水方向，對照試驗區時間曲線，檢查塗抹與井阻是否主導。~Use consolidation tests and multilevel pore pressure to define drainage direction, comparing trial-area time histories and checking whether smear or well resistance dominates. || 把理想百分之四時間當實際排程，會提前卸除預壓，留下未消散孔壓與後續沉陷。~Using the ideal four-percent time as a schedule can release surcharge early, leaving excess pressure and later settlement. || 排水距離減成五分之一，現場工期一定固定變成百分之四。~Reducing drainage length to one fifth always makes the field duration exactly four percent. || 設計者應分開記錄尺度示意與實際徑向壓密模型；卸載須依觀測而非單一平方比例放行。~The designer separates scaling illustration from actual radial-consolidation modelling; unloading follows observations rather than one squared ratio. || 本比值特別保持無因次參數不變，並非排水板間距改變後的工期比；實際n、塗抹與井阻會一同變動。~This ratio explicitly holds dimensionless parameters fixed and is not the schedule ratio after changing drain spacing; actual size ratio, smear and well resistance change together.
三角網格影響徑~Triangular-grid influence diameter || 排水板網格把土體分成單井影響單元，等效圓面積用於徑向壓密分析。三角形與方形排列有不同的面積換算，施工偏位及漏插又會形成較大未排水區；名目間距需要與實際安裝位置一起驗證。~A drain grid divides soil into influence cells, represented by equivalent circular area in radial analysis. Triangular and square layouts use different area conversions, while misplaced or omitted drains create larger undrained zones. Nominal spacing therefore requires verification against actual installation positions rather than reliance on the layout drawing alone. || 三角形網格假設間距s=1.2 m，等效影響直徑de≈1.05s=1.26 m~For a triangular grid with spacing s=1.2 m, equivalent influence diameter de≈1.05s=1.26 m || 將實際插設座標與設計網格疊合，檢查邊界、障礙物及漏插區，計算最不利單元面積。~Overlay actual installation coordinates on the design grid, checking boundaries, obstacles and omissions and calculating adverse influence-cell areas. || 漏插或偏位可能留下排水盲區，周圍測點反應良好仍無法代表該局部壓密程度。~Omission or displacement leaves a drainage blind zone that favourable surrounding measurements do not represent. || 三角與方形網格可以無條件用相同的等效直徑係數。~Triangular and square grids can always use the same influence-diameter coefficient. || 竣工網格須保留實際位置與未完成深度；地工設計者核定補插及監測點代表性後才驗收。~As-built grids retain actual positions and incomplete depths; the geotechnical designer approves additional drains and monitoring representativeness before acceptance. || 係數一點零五是等面積近似，不描述邊界單元或排水不均；異常網格應以實際幾何重新建立模型。~The coefficient is an equal-area approximation, not a model of boundary cells or uneven drainage; irregular grids require revised geometry.
帶狀排水板等效徑~Equivalent band-drain diameter || 排水板是帶狀而非圓管，徑向土體分析常以等效圓直徑表示其周長效果。寬度與厚度之外，濾布透水性、芯材通道及受壓後變形都影響排水，幾何等效不等於水力容量等效，也不能直接套用砂井直徑。~Band drains are not circular pipes, so radial soil analysis commonly uses an equivalent diameter related to perimeter. Width and thickness do not capture filter permeability, core channels or compression. Geometric equivalence therefore is not hydraulic-capacity equivalence and cannot be substituted directly for a sand-drain diameter. || 假設帶寬b=0.10 m、厚t=0.004 m，等周長等效dw=2(b+t)/π=0.0662 m~For width b=0.10 m and thickness t=0.004 m, perimeter-equivalent dw=2(b+t)/π=0.0662 m || 核對產品尺寸與受圍壓排水試驗，檢查彎折後通道及濾布狀態，分列等效直徑與通水量。~Verify product dimensions and confined-flow tests, inspect channels and filter after bending, and report equivalent diameter separately from discharge capacity. || 只按等效直徑選材可能忽略芯材壓潰或濾布堵塞，實際井阻遠大於設計假設。~Selecting by equivalent diameter alone can miss crushed cores or clogged filters, producing much greater well resistance than assumed. || 等效直徑相同的排水板就一定有相同通水能力。~Drains with the same equivalent diameter have identical discharge capacity. || 材料驗收應核對受壓、彎折及濾布試驗條件；設計者確認與實際土壓及沉陷相符後才採用。~Acceptance checks confinement, bending and filter test conditions; the designer confirms their relevance to actual earth pressure and settlement before use. || 等周長式屬模型近似，不是流道內徑；受壓排水能力及土體濾層相容性需要獨立的水力試驗。~The perimeter relation is a modelling approximation, not internal channel diameter; confined discharge and soil-filter compatibility need separate hydraulic tests.
徑向時間因子~Radial time factor || 徑向壓密的時間因子把水平壓密係數、時間及單井影響尺寸結合，便於比較不同觀測時段。它本身不是壓密完成度，還需井徑比、塗抹與井阻的函數；水平係數也不能無條件用垂直壓密試驗值替代。~The radial time factor combines horizontal consolidation coefficient, time and cell size to compare observation periods. It is not itself degree of consolidation, which also depends on drain-size ratio, smear and well resistance. Horizontal coefficients cannot automatically be replaced by vertical-test values without justification of anisotropy. || 假設ch=0.01 m²/day、t=100 day、de=1.26 m，Tr=ch t/de²=0.630，無因次~For ch=0.01 m²/day, t=100 day and de=1.26 m, Tr=ch t/de²=0.630, dimensionless || 以試驗區孔壓及沉陷曲線反算ch範圍，保留獨立測點驗證，確認時間單位與係數完全一致。~Back-analyse a range of ch from trial-area pressure and settlement, retain independent validation points, and verify consistent time units in all coefficients. || 把日與秒混用會造成巨大工期誤差，把Tr當完成率則會在機制尚未確認時提前卸載。~Mixing days and seconds creates major schedule errors, while treating Tr as completion percentage can release surcharge before the mechanism is verified. || 徑向時間因子等於零點六三就代表完成百分之六十三。~A radial time factor of 0.63 means sixty-three-percent consolidation. || 計算書須標示ch的試驗方向、單位與應力範圍；地工設計者核准完整壓密函數後再作排程推估。~State ch direction, units and stress range; the geotechnical designer approves the full consolidation function before schedule estimation. || 本算例明確使用平方公尺每一天，時間亦以天計；要從Tr求壓密度，還必須指定所採理論及全部無因次參數。~This example explicitly uses square metres per day and time in days; converting Tr to consolidation degree still requires the selected theory and all dimensionless parameters.
塗抹區滲透性~Smear-zone permeability || 插設套管擾動排水板周圍土體，可能重塑黏土並形成低水平滲透性的塗抹區。排水路徑雖變短，水仍需穿越這個局部阻力；因此增加排水板數量不一定按理想比例加速壓密，工具尺寸與土體敏感性需共同考慮。~Installation mandrels disturb surrounding soil, potentially remoulding clay into a zone of lower horizontal permeability. Although the drainage path shortens, water must still cross this local resistance. More drains therefore need not accelerate consolidation by the ideal proportion, and tool size and soil sensitivity must be considered together. || 假設塗抹區ks=1×10⁻⁹ m/s、未擾動kh=5×10⁻⁹ m/s，比值ks/kh=0.20~For smear permeability ks=1×10⁻⁹ m/s and undisturbed kh=5×10⁻⁹ m/s, ks/kh=0.20 || 比較靠近及遠離排水板的孔壓消散，核對套管尺寸與土體重塑試驗，辨識塗抹半徑和滲透性的不確定度。~Compare dissipation near and away from drains, verify mandrel dimensions and remoulding tests, and assess uncertainty in smear radius and permeability. || 忽略塗抹會高估排水速率，試驗區尚未達預期便需重新解釋模型，而非只增加預壓荷重。~Ignoring smear overpredicts drainage rate; underperforming trials require model reassessment rather than merely adding surcharge. || 插設擾動只影響施工方便，對長期排水速度沒有影響。~Installation disturbance affects convenience but not long-term drainage rate. || 安裝設備與套管尺寸變更需重審塗抹假設；地工設計者以試驗區反應核定實際設計參數。~Changing installation equipment or mandrel size requires review of smear assumptions; the geotechnical designer approves parameters using trial-area response. || 滲透比不足以完整描述塗抹效應，還需要塗抹區尺寸與原土各向異性；不能把本比值當普遍材料常數。~Permeability ratio alone does not define smear; its extent and native-soil anisotropy are also needed, and this ratio is not universal.
排水井阻~Well resistance || 水進入排水板後還必須沿芯材向排水層流動，長排水板、圍壓及彎折可能造成顯著井阻。把排水板當成零水頭損失邊界會高估深部排水，砂墊層及出口不暢也可能限制整個系統，需分辨土內阻力與排水通道阻力。~After entering the drain, water travels along the core to an outlet. Long drains, confinement and bending can create significant well resistance. Assuming zero drain head loss overestimates deep drainage, while a restricted blanket or outlet can govern the whole system. Distinguish soil resistance from resistance inside the drainage path. || 假設水頭損失Δh=2 m、流量Q=0.0001 m³/s，等效水力阻力R=Δh/Q=20000 s/m²~For head loss Δh=2 m and discharge Q=0.0001 m³/s, hydraulic resistance R=Δh/Q=20000 s/m² || 量測排水通道上不同高程水頭並核對出水量，將受壓通水試驗與現場彎折及沉陷條件比較。~Measure heads at different elevations along the drainage path and outlet flow, comparing confined discharge tests with field bending and settlement. || 出口堵塞或芯材壓縮會讓深部孔壓消散落後，表層沉陷較快也不能證明全深有效排水。~A blocked outlet or compressed core delays deep pressure dissipation, and rapid shallow settlement does not prove effective full-depth drainage. || 水進入排水板後就沒有任何沿程水頭損失。~Water experiences no head loss after entering a vertical drain. || 交接須含排水墊層與出口通達性；地工及排水設計者確認整條流路後才接受排水系統。~Handover includes drainage blankets and outlet access; geotechnical and drainage designers confirm the entire path before accepting the system. || 這是指定工況的等效阻力而非材料常數，與長度、圍壓及流量條件有關；井阻模型需保留實際排水方向。~This is equivalent resistance for one condition, not a material constant; length, confinement and flow matter, and the well-resistance model must retain the actual drainage direction.
有效應力成長~Effective-stress gain || 預壓荷載初期可主要轉成超額孔壓，隨排水消散，更多荷載才移交給土骨架並引起壓密。若只量測地表荷重而沒有孔壓，就不能判定有效應力增加多少；水位變化與不同土層的初始壓力也需用同一基準處理。~Surcharge may initially appear mainly as excess pore pressure; drainage progressively transfers more load to the skeleton and causes consolidation. Applied surface load alone cannot establish effective-stress gain without pressure observations. Groundwater changes and layer-specific initial pressures also require one consistent reference. || 假設總應力增量Δσ=80 kPa、殘餘超額孔壓Δu=30 kPa，Δσ′=Δσ−Δu=50 kPa~For total-stress increment Δσ=80 kPa and remaining excess pressure Δu=30 kPa, effective increment Δσ′=Δσ−Δu=50 kPa || 以多深度孔壓與預壓高程核對荷載歷程，確認儀器基準水壓及地下水位變化，分層求有效增量。~Use multilevel pore pressure and surcharge elevation to reconstruct load history, checking baseline pressure and groundwater changes before calculating layer-wise effective increments. || 把預壓全重當成已完成有效應力，會高估土體強度及壓密度，卸載後留下可觀後續沉陷。~Treating all surcharge as mobilized effective stress overstates strength and consolidation and can leave substantial later settlement after unloading. || 加上八十千帕預壓，就立刻增加八十千帕有效應力。~Applying eighty kilopascals of surcharge immediately adds the same effective stress. || 每階段荷載與孔壓應同步歸檔；地工設計者確認有效應力及穩定需求後才核准加載或卸載。~Archive each loading stage with synchronized pore pressures; the geotechnical designer confirms effective stress and stability requirements before loading or unloading. || 增量式需同一位置與時刻且正負號一致，不能把絕對孔壓混入超額孔壓；總應力分布還受荷載擴散影響。~The increment relation requires the same location, time and sign convention; absolute and excess pressures are not interchangeable, and total stress also reflects load spread.
對數壓縮沉陷~Logarithmic compression settlement || 正常壓密黏土在一維條件下可用壓縮指數與有效應力對數關係估算沉陷，排水板主要改變到達此沉陷的速度而非終值。若存在先期壓密、不同應力路徑或次壓密，需分段採用相應參數，不能把一條正常壓密線套用所有土層。~For normally consolidated clay in one-dimensional conditions, compression index and logarithmic effective stress estimate settlement. Drains mainly change how quickly settlement occurs rather than its ultimate value. Preconsolidation, different stress paths and secondary compression require appropriate segments and parameters instead of one virgin-compression line for every layer. || 假設Cc=0.3、H=10 m、e₀=1.0、σ′₀=100 kPa、σ′f=150 kPa，s=CcH/(1+e₀) log₁₀(σ′f/σ′₀)=0.264 m~For Cc=0.3, H=10 m, e₀=1.0, σ′₀=100 kPa and σ′f=150 kPa, s=CcH/(1+e₀) log₁₀(σ′f/σ′₀)=0.264 m || 以壓密試驗核對先期壓密壓力與指數，使用分層沉陷計比較，確認應力增量及厚度代表性。~Check preconsolidation pressure and indices from consolidation tests, compare layered settlement, and verify representative stress increments and thicknesses. || 誤把超壓密土全程用正常壓密指數，可能高估或錯估沉陷；忽略次壓密則會漏掉長期變形。~Applying virgin compression throughout an overconsolidated path mispredicts settlement, while neglecting secondary compression misses long-term movement. || 裝設排水板會把軟土的最終壓縮沉陷直接消除。~Installing vertical drains directly eliminates ultimate compressive settlement of soft soil. || 設計與交接應分開主要壓密及長期次壓密預測；地工設計者確認參數適用應力範圍後再解讀監測。~Separate primary and secondary settlement in design and handover; the geotechnical designer confirms parameter stress ranges before interpreting monitoring. || 此式明定正常壓密、一維及以十為底對數，未含側移；Cc為無因次斜率，不能與以自然對數定義的參數混用。~The formula specifies normally consolidated one-dimensional behaviour and base-ten logarithms, excluding lateral movement; dimensionless Cc cannot be mixed with a natural-log parameter.
排水能力衰減~Discharge-capacity deterioration || 排水板隨土體沉陷彎折、圍壓增加或濾布堵塞，通水能力可能下降，因此出廠直條試驗不足以代表全工期。衰減比例應在相同水力坡降與圍壓下比較，才能辨別材料性能改變；現場出水下降也可能單純因超額孔壓已減少。~Drain bending during settlement, rising confinement and filter clogging can reduce discharge, so a straight factory test does not represent the whole project. Compare deterioration at consistent gradient and confinement to identify material change. Falling field discharge may instead reflect reduced excess pressure and must not automatically be called clogging. || 在相同試驗條件下，通水量Q₀=100 L/h降至Q₁=70 L/h，衰減(Q₀−Q₁)/Q₀=30%~Under identical test conditions, discharge falls from Q₀=100 L/h to Q₁=70 L/h, giving deterioration of 30% || 以受壓彎折試驗比較前後通水量，現場則同步看孔壓與排水量，區分能力下降及驅動水頭減少。~Compare confined bent-drain discharge before and after conditioning; in the field assess pressure and flow together to distinguish capacity loss from reduced driving head. || 忽略彎折與堵塞會讓深部排水變慢，若只按初始材料性能安排卸載，就可能留下殘餘孔壓。~Ignoring bending and clogging slows deep drainage; unloading based only on initial material performance can leave residual pressure. || 現場出水量減少就一定表示排水板已經堵塞。~Reduced field discharge necessarily means the drain has clogged. || 材料試驗需涵蓋預期圍壓與變形；地工設計者核定能力折減，營運端保留出口維護與監測責任。~Material tests cover anticipated confinement and deformation; the geotechnical designer approves capacity reduction while operators retain outlet-maintenance and monitoring responsibility. || 百分比只對相同試驗邊界成立，不能把不同水頭下的流量直接比較；通水衰減也不等於壓密速度同比下降。~The percentage requires identical test boundaries; flow at different heads is not directly comparable, and capacity loss does not imply proportional slowing of consolidation.
壓密度與卸載~Consolidation and unloading || 由實測沉陷除以估計最終主要壓密沉陷，可得到沉陷定義的平均壓密度，但分母本身有模型不確定度。地表沉陷可能混入側移或次壓密，孔壓定義的完成度也未必一致；卸載必須用多種證據確認剩餘變形符合資產需求。~Measured settlement divided by estimated ultimate primary settlement gives a settlement-based average consolidation degree, but its denominator is uncertain. Surface settlement may include lateral movement or secondary compression, and a pressure-based degree need not match exactly. Unloading therefore requires multiple evidence streams that confirm tolerable residual movement. || 假設已發生主要壓密沉陷s=240 mm、估計終值s∞=300 mm，Us=s/s∞=0.80=80%~For measured primary settlement s=240 mm and estimated ultimate s∞=300 mm, Us=s/s∞=0.80=80% || 比較沉陷外推與多深度孔壓消散，檢查最終沉陷估算對資料時窗的敏感度，保留未達標層位。~Compare settlement extrapolation with multilevel pressure dissipation, test sensitivity of ultimate-settlement estimates to the data window, and retain unresolved layers explicitly. || 高估已完成比例會提前移除預壓，營運載重後再產生沉陷；只用地表平均可能漏掉深部未壓密層。~Overstating completion releases surcharge early and permits later settlement; surface averages can miss deep unconsolidated layers. || 地表沉陷看似停止就表示所有深度的孔壓都消散。~Apparently stopped surface settlement proves pore pressure has dissipated at every depth. || 卸載移交應由地工設計者及資產管理者共同核准，列明剩餘沉陷、回彈及長期監測條件。~The geotechnical designer and asset owner jointly approve unloading and handover, documenting residual settlement, rebound and long-term monitoring conditions. || 此壓密度以可靠的主要壓密終值為前提，不是通用卸載門檻；若終值重估，比例及殘餘沉陷都必須一起更新。~This degree assumes a reliable ultimate primary settlement and is not a universal unloading threshold; revised ultimate estimates require updating both the ratio and residual settlement.
'''),'原創教學例：僅作固定無因次幾何與材料參數的擴散尺度比較，長路徑Llong=5 m、短路徑Lshort=1 m，時間比tshort/tlong=(1/5)²=0.0400。若短路徑增加10%至1.1 m，時間比變為(1.1/5)²=0.0484，比原比值增加21%。這不是排水板網格改變後的實際工期比例，因為井徑比、塗抹範圍及井阻可能同步改變。工程設計仍須用完整徑向壓密關係並配合孔壓、沉陷與排水能力觀測，確認各層剩餘壓密而非直接套用平方比。~Original teaching example: compare diffusion scales only while holding dimensionless geometry and material parameters fixed. With Llong=5 m and Lshort=1 m, tshort/tlong=(1/5)²=0.0400. Increasing the short length by 10% to 1.1 m changes the ratio to (1.1/5)²=0.0484, a 21% increase in that ratio. This is not the actual schedule ratio after changing a drain grid, because drain-size ratio, smear extent and well resistance may change simultaneously. Engineering design still requires the complete radial-consolidation relationship and observations of pore pressure, settlement and discharge capacity to establish residual consolidation in each layer.',['keller-drains','fhwa-ground','geo-site'],['Crossrail地表沉陷監測：排水機理比較~Crossrail settlement monitoring: drainage-mechanism comparison','赤柱岩洞：地下空間與地基條件對照~Stanley caverns: underground-space and ground-condition contrast'])
if __name__=='__main__': write()
